    rdfs:comment """1.50.0 (2026-11-26): Closure. All 19 stories and 39 tasks Done and all nine objectives measured at their targets (1.49.0). The Owner's ruling of 2026-11-26 00:07 Istanbul: no confirmation is needed for the closure as long as the conditions hold; they hold. Outcome Out_Achieved (full achievement). Closure report: 07-lineage/CLOSURE_REPORT_sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage_Lineage10_v1_0_0.md. The archive step goes in the next release."""@en .

